Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}I'm Christina Koch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:04.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm a mission specialist\Non the Artemis II mission to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.43,0:00:09.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,When I first found out that I was assigned\Nto Artemis II, my thoughts were disbelief,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,an immense sense of honor\Nand responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:13.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,and readiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to try to make everyone proud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:19.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,and to really fulfill what this\Nmission truly means to all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:22.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,For me, there's never really been a time\Nwhen I didn't want to be an astronaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:26.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Going back, as far as I can remember,\Nit's what I always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:29.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think the spark was really lit\Nwhen I visited Kennedy Space Center
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:33.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,with my family and came home\Nwith a bunch of posters that then went up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:37.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the walls of my bedroom and became\Nthe things that I dreamed of from then on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:38.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,When I think about the Artemis II crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:42.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,my first thought is that I am\Nso privileged to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:45.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,These other astronauts\Nhave an amazing history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,amazing record, amazing experience,\Nand they're great people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:50.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've known them all for many, many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:52.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've had a chance to work\Nwith them in different capacities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:55.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I think our skills\Nreally complement each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:56.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,They all have a military background,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:01:00.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I come from a more raw,\Ntechnical engineering background,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:03.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I think that that complements\None another really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think we'll work together great,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:09.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I hope to be someone on the crew\Nthat really is that engineering expert,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}and I hope that that can be the way\Nthat I contribute the most.
